.el .ds Aq '
.TH start-cli-s9pk-publish 1  "publish "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-s9pk\-publish \- Publish s9pk to S3 bucket and index on registry
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli s9pk publish\fR [\fB\-\-private\fR] [\fB\-\-reader\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIS9PK\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Publish s9pk to S3 bucket and index on registry
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-private\fR
Host the s9pk encrypted with a key derived from your identity, visible only to admins, publishers, and the given readers
.TP
\fB\-\-reader\fR \fI<READERS>\fR
Registered reader key allowed to see the private s9pk, in PEM or DER Base64 format
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIS9PK\fR>
Path to s9pk package file
